{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">2005 AMC 12B #12</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">2005 AMC 10B #16</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458b4d1201902828abe8b79853ca966928b6c4f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+mx+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" /> has roots twice those of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7ca78795861fe42b37d1528e83bd86840b3b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+px+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, and none of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ceed1f5c723a6e397dd8aa9fb1cfb894e1f6a91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is zero. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab7f0a5544f40bcbf65297ce862fede3548ddde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad3799d69d56dd51f832e7a629a2ead7098ac3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\ {{{1}}} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\ {{{2}}} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\ {{{4}}} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\ {{{8}}} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ {{{16}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"392\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f705b7c6db594911e9e4a3d3f8fbee1a2abfea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + px + m = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" /> have roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Then \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d6347a5ee25d5b941694ca5cd21c35997e6d31f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + px + m = (x-a)(x-b) = x^2 - (a+b)x + ab,\\]\" width=\"404\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51b634644112024b7d7ff198b4283a6bce1b7e2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = -(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbdcf19d4801d74203e8f7aeeebca67c8930e409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = ab$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdca714c46067aa5f072d52a51c25ad36821b437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + mx + n = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b30259d95f64f9aa7c6bd36e1583618a23c8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501f7835ffc0da1ceef39eaa3eebb8784db663d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + mx + n = (x-2a)(x-2b) = x^2 - 2(a+b)x + 4ab,\\]\" width=\"442\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/6/0f628175c3874d8ac94be8d194d42df54e24d00f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = -2(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c9863bb93d6abee66cbcdb7690b3a4a1b0d8fd5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 4ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d1097f71fde4cc5f2d89b9b10716987be29af40e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{p} = \\frac{4ab}{-(a+b)} = \\frac{4m}{\\frac{m}{2}} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"247\" height=\"46\" />. \n</p><p>To test that this actually works, consider the quadratics <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b8c0a10b2f46e658cb8afe23b66964e770322a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + 8x + 16 = 0,\\ x^2 + 16x + 64 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"288\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdca714c46067aa5f072d52a51c25ad36821b437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + mx + n = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b30259d95f64f9aa7c6bd36e1583618a23c8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f705b7c6db594911e9e4a3d3f8fbee1a2abfea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + px + m = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, then using Vieta's formulas,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/e/08ecb4147711eacc9e46c3025ecf06f134ac14d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a + 2b = -m\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/b/02b64c3d1b6523bbb51defb309c6d0549b692b29.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + b = -p\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c586dee72aa6367bb10d8204969336903bd179.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a(2b) = n\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/4/d14005e53d35d168169a64841d4ceef3b3b42600.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(b) = m\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />\nTherefore, substituting the second equation into the first equation gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/e/b1ee6cc0acfd106f4f1d26965b77854e3878ea4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m = 2(p)\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />\nand substituting the fourth equation into the third equation gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bbe2b999bd85bf79835ac644e6dfb2a4587e4d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 4(m)\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/f/d0ffba17d89c1ecc0c971fc29fa177f13e976b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c4385c14fb274dd0de9cc30bcab312ae31fddfbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{p}= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=1023\">https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=1023</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B\">2005 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems